\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Proposed framework linking microrobot physics, local behavioral rules, and collective behavior. Acoustic propulsion, magnetic interactions, and mechanical logic realize local response laws. The forward problem predicts collective behavior from robot design through these rules; the inverse problem identifies rules and designs needed for desired collective behavior.}}{1}{}\protected@file@percent }
